--------------------------------------------------
1. PRIMARY PRODUCT TEST
--------------------------------------------------

A user looking at the Docker view should be able to understand:

    CURRENT STATE
        ↓
    HEALTH / EFFICIENCY ASSESSMENT
        ↓
    CONCERNS
        ↓
    EVIDENCE
        ↓
    POSSIBLE NEXT STEPS

Example:

    65 Containers
        ↓
    42 Running
    15 Stopped
    8 Review Candidates
        ↓
    Why are 8 review candidates?
        ↓
    Stopped for a long period / unused image / high resource use / other evidence
        ↓
    Possible next step:
    Review ownership and confirm whether the container is still required

The application should NOT make destructive decisions automatically.

Prefer:

    Review
    Investigate
    Verify ownership
    Confirm usage
    Consider cleanup

Avoid unsupported conclusions such as:

    Safe to delete
    Definitely unused
    Must remove

